                        %mo ,
                        %mi …
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f_1,f_2,\dots
                  range over A; the contexts are assumed to be canonical i.e. consisting of all free distinct variables occurring in a sequent listed in order of first appearance.
